# Build output
dist/
.vinxi/

# gen:previews Tailwind compile scratch (removed after each run; safety net)
.gen-preview-css-tmp/

# Docs publish plane (ADR 2026-07-29): monorepo docs/ is the only authoring SoT.
# Public markdown is NOT materialized into public/*.md. Keep ignoring any
# leftover generated .md / copied subdirs from the pre-virtual-serve era so they
# can never be committed. Hand-authored docs-pro/ stays tracked.
public/*.md
public/*/

# Hand-authored Pro documentation (tracked)
!public/docs-pro/
!public/docs-pro/**

